# a team: boxes inside a list, and a list inside each box
me has team list (box name "grok" bag (list "club")) (box name "zug" bag (list))

me can give_item who thing
    bag of who gain thing

me give_item (item 2 of team) "rock"
me give_item (item 1 of team) "fire"
each fighter in team
    say name of fighter + " has " + size of bag of fighter + " things: " + (me join bag of fighter ", ")
say team
say item 2 of bag of item 1 of team
